05.02-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"先别动这个。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မထိသေးနဲ့။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S018_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这个先不要动。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မထိသေးနဲ့။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"你试一下。","meaning_my":"စမ်းလုပ်ကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"对，就是这样。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ အဲဒီလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"先按这个按钮。","meaning_my":"အရင် ဒီခလုတ်ကို နှိပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"是这个按钮吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီခလုတ်လား။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"按住这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို ဖိထားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要按多久？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လောက်ကြာကြာ ဖိထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"一直按着这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို ဆက်ဖိထားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"点这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို နှိပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，点一下就行吗？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ တစ်ချက်နှိပ်ရုံနဲ့ ရပြီလား။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S023_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"按这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို နှိပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S023_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"往左滑。","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဘက်ကို ပွတ်ဆွဲပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，是这样滑吗？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဒီလို ဆွဲရမှာလား။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S024_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"向左滑。","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဘက်ကို ပွတ်ဆွဲပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S024_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"往右滑。","meaning_my":"ညာဘက်ကို ပွတ်ဆွဲပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S025_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"向右滑。","meaning_my":"ညာဘက်ကို ပွတ်ဆွဲပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S025_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S026","kind":"main","cn":"先关掉再打开。","meaning_my":"အရင် ပိတ်ပြီး ပြန်ဖွင့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S026_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"关了再开。","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ပြီးမှ ပြန်ဖွင့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S026_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S027","kind":"main","cn":"插在这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ထိုးထည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S027_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"插进去就行吗？","meaning_my":"ထိုးထည့်လိုက်ရင် ရပြီလား။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S027_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S028","kind":"main","cn":"对准这里。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာနဲ့ တည့်အောင် ချိန်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S029","kind":"main","cn":"先别松手。","meaning_my":"အခု လက်မလွှတ်သေးနဲ့။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S030","kind":"main","cn":"好了，你来试试。","meaning_my":"ရပြီ၊ အခု စမ်းကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S030_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"行，你自己试试。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ကိုယ့်ဘာသာ စမ်းကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S030_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S031","kind":"main","cn":"我做一遍，你跟着做。","meaning_my":"တစ်ခေါက် လုပ်ပြမယ်၊ လိုက်လုပ်ကြည့်နော်။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S032","kind":"main","cn":"不对，再试一次。","meaning_my":"မဟုတ်သေးဘူး၊ နောက်တစ်ခေါက် စမ်းကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S032.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S032_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不对，重新来。","meaning_my":"မဟုတ်သေးဘူး၊ ပြန်လုပ်ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S032_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S033","kind":"main","cn":"我还是不会。","meaning_my":"မလုပ်တတ်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S033.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S033_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"没事，我再教你一遍。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နောက်တစ်ခေါက် ထပ်သင်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S033_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S033_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"还是没学会。","meaning_my":"မတတ်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S033_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S034","kind":"main","cn":"这一步做完了吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီအဆင့် ပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S034.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.02-S034_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"做完了，接下来呢？","meaning_my":"ပြီးပြီ၊ နောက်တစ်ဆင့် ဘာလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.02-S034_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"能带我过去吗？","meaning_my":"လိုက်ပို့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我带你去。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လိုက်ပို့ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"可以领我过去吗？","meaning_my":"လိုက်ပို့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"跟我来。","meaning_my":"လိုက်ခဲ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"跟着我。","meaning_my":"နောက်လိုက်ခဲ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"可以带我去前台吗？","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ကြိုကောင်တာကို လိုက်ပို့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，跟我来。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ လိုက်ခဲ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"能带我去一下前台吗？","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ကြိုကောင်တာကို လိုက်ပို့ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"我找不到入口。","meaning_my":"ဝင်ပေါက် ရှာမတွေ့ဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"就在那边，我带你去。","meaning_my":"ဟိုဘက်မှာပဲ၊ လိုက်ပို့ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"我不知道怎么走。","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လိုသွားရမလဲ မသိဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"没事，跟我走就行。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နောက်လိုက်ခဲ့နော်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S005_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我不认识路。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမသိဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S005_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"从这边走。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်က သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"到了，就是这儿。","meaning_my":"ရောက်ပြီ၊ ဒီနေရာပဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"进去以后往哪儿走？","meaning_my":"အထဲဝင်ပြီး ဘယ်ဘက်သွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"进去以后往左走。","meaning_my":"အထဲဝင်ပြီး ဘယ်ဘက်ကို သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"进门后怎么走？","meaning_my":"အထဲဝင်ပြီး ဘယ်လိုသွားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"电梯就在旁边。","meaning_my":"ဓာတ်လှေကားက ဘေးနားမှာပဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"进门后左转。","meaning_my":"တံခါးက ဝင်ပြီး ဘယ်ဘက်ကွေ့ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，左转以后呢？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ဘယ်ဘက်ကွေ့ပြီးရင်ရော။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"快到了。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"马上到了。","meaning_my":"ရောက်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"不好意思，我现在走不开。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ အခု ဒီနေရာက မထွက်နိုင်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"我只能带你到门口。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝအထိပဲ လိုက်ပို့ပေးနိုင်မယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"只能送到门口。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဝအထိပဲ လိုက်ပို့ပေးနိုင်မယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"到这里就行。","meaning_my":"ဒီအထိဆို ရပြီ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S014_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"送到这儿就行了。","meaning_my":"ဒီအထိပဲ လိုက်ပို့ရင် ရပြီ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S014_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我第一次来这儿。","meaning_my":"ဒီကို ပထမဆုံးလာတာ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我带你过去。","meaning_my":"လိုက်ပို့ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"从这里一直往前走。","meaning_my":"ဒီကနေ ရှေ့တည့်တည့် ဆက်သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要走多久？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လောက်ကြာကြာ လျှောက်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"在大厅等我。","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ခန်းမမှာ စောင့်နေနော်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S018_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"在大厅等着。","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ခန်းမမှာ စောင့်နေနော်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"穿过大厅就到了。","meaning_my":"ခန်းမကို ဖြတ်သွားရင် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"从后门出去。","meaning_my":"နောက်တံခါးကနေ ထွက်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，后门在哪边？","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နောက်တံခါး ဘယ်ဘက်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"还有多远？","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက်ဝေးသေးလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"再走两分钟就到了。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် နှစ်မိနစ်လောက် လျှောက်ရင် ရောက်ပြီ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S021_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"还得走多远？","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက် သွားရဦးမလဲ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S021_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你先在这儿等我。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ခဏ စောင့်နေနော်။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"走错了，往回走。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှားသွားပြီ၊ ပြန်လှည့်သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.05.03-S023_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"走反了，往回走。","meaning_my":"ပြောင်းပြန်ဘက် သွားမိပြီ၊ ပြန်လှည့်သွားပါ။","audio_file":"01.05.03-S023_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
